# Dogfood pack: a header value must not reach a filesystem write path.
#
# This is the brief's third property, instantiated on the helper under
# `scry/corpus/prover/helper/Files.cs`. `Path.GetFileName` is the sanitiser the pack
# already names for path traversal; the sink is the file write's path argument.
rule path-traversal
  kind taint
  severity error
  message An unvalidated header value reaches a filesystem write
  source Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpRequest.get_Headers result
  sanitise System.IO.Path.GetFileName result
  sink System.IO.File.WriteAllText arg 0
  sink System.IO.File.WriteAllBytes arg 0
  sink System.IO.File.AppendAllText arg 0
  sink System.IO.FileStream..ctor arg 0
end
